  "text": "Làm đềtrực tuyến tại: https://ielts-fighter.com/online-test.html\nWebsite tựhọc IELTS: https://ielts-fighter.com\nPART 3\nROSIE:\nColin, I'm really struggling to think of a topic for our human geography\nassignment.\nCOLIN:\nMe too, Rosie. I'll tell you what, let's think about the different aspects of\nhuman geography and see if we can narrow the topic down a bit to help us\ndecide.\nROSIE:\nOK. So one aspect is population. That would be all about population density\nand migration and so on. Lots of facts and statistics. Maybe a bit boring?\nCOLIN:\nYeah, but quite straightforward to find on the internet.\nROSIE:\nSuppose so. How about health? I'd never thought about the links between\nthat and geography until Professor Lee gave us that lecture on cholera. How in\nthe 19th century, a physician used street plans and plans of water supplies to\nfind the source of a cholera epidemic.\nCOLIN:\nYes, fascinating, wasn’t it? Or we could do something more general like\neconomies.\nROSIE:\nSo how financial and commercial factors are linked to the physical\nenvironment.\nCOLIN:\nYeah.\nROSIE:\nI thought that had been taken off the syllabus for this year.\n",
