      "text": "PART 3\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        118.65204620361328,
        110.42239379882812,
        138.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        138.75469970703125,
        474.467529296875,
        177.47360229492188
      ],
      "text": "Colin, I'm really struggling to think of a topic for our human geography\nassignment.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        190.29205322265625,
        111.62239837646484,
        209.79345703125
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        210.2747039794922,
        497.49310302734375,
        268.9136047363281
      ],
      "text": "Me too, Rosie. I'll tell you what, let's think about the different aspects of\nhuman geography and see if we can narrow the topic down a bit to help us\ndecide.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        281.7320251464844,
        110.42239379882812,
        301.2334289550781
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        301.8346862792969,
        505.30718994140625,
        340.43359375
      ],
      "text": "OK. So one aspect is population. That would be all about population density\nand migration and so on. Lots of facts and statistics. Maybe a bit boring?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        353.37103271484375,
        111.62239837646484,
        372.8724365234375
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        373.4747009277344,
        387.53729248046875,
        392.27362060546875
      ],
      "text": "Yeah, but quite straightforward to find on the internet.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        405.092041015625,
        110.42239379882812,
        424.59344482421875
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        425.0746765136719,
        517.97509765625,
        503.51361083984375
      ],
      "text": "Suppose so. How about health? I'd never thought about the links between\nthat and geography until Professor Lee gave us that lecture on cholera. How in\nthe 19th century, a physician used street plans and plans of water supplies to\nfind the source of a cholera epidemic.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        516.4520263671875,
        111.62239837646484,
        535.9534301757812
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        536.4346923828125,
        480.0219421386719,
        575.152587890625
      ],
      "text": "Yes, fascinating, wasn’t it? Or we could do something more general like\neconomies.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        588.092041015625,
        110.42239379882812,
        607.5934448242188
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        608.07470703125,
        450.214599609375,
        646.673583984375
      ],
      "text": "So how financial and commercial factors are linked to the physical\nenvironment.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        659.6110229492188,
        111.62239837646484,
        679.1124267578125
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        679.7147216796875,
        106.49895477294922,
        698.5136108398438
      ],
      "text": "Yeah.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        711.33203125,
        110.42239379882812,
        730.8334350585938
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        731.4346923828125,
        410.3385009765625,
        750.2335815429688
      ],
      "text": "I thought that had been taken off the syllabus for this year.\n"
